    "text": "tetongravity.com\nwebsite\nSanta Clarita\nSoCal Town Breaks Ground on Haskell Canyon Bike Park\nBy Nico Johnson,\n1 hours agoPeople and bikes are like peanut butter and jelly. We're good together. Bikes get you where you want to go. You breathe fresh air. Pedaling doesn't pollute. Heck, if you're not careful, you may even catch some exercise. In a world built for bikes, everyone is safe, fit, and gets where they need to go. Haskell Canyon Bike Park is helping bring the vision to life.",
